# history (the repository has public forks). The in-repo scanner
# (nasdx/secret_scan.py) already ignores them via its entropy/length gate;
# only gitleaks' deliberately broader `generic-api-key` rule matches.
#
# New code must NOT add literal fake tokens. Build them at runtime by
# concatenating fragments, the way tests/test_secret_scan_contracts.py does.

